---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="About this site: networking and programming notes"
	pubDate={new Date('2026-08-29')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		This is a personal tech blog hosted on GitHub Pages. I use it to keep notes on networking and
		programming.
	</p>
	<p>Topics I cover:</p>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Networking</strong>: TCP/IP, routing and switching, firewalls, packet capture, troubleshooting</li>
		<li><strong>Programming</strong>: automation scripts, ops tooling, data structures and algorithms</li>
		<li><strong>Labs</strong>: topologies, config snippets, and how problems were diagnosed</li>
	</ul>
	<p>
		The site is built with Astro. Content is Markdown only — static files, no database, no backend.
		Push a change to GitHub and the site redeploys automatically.
	</p>
	<p>Daily workflow is documented in the repository README.</p>
</Layout>
